extends ../baseEmail

block content
  - const formattedDate = new Date(payload.user.subscriptionEndDate).toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })
  p Hi there!

  p We're sorry to see you go! Your subscription will be canceled at the end of your current billing period on: #{formattedDate}.

  p We would love to hear your feedback. Please let us know why you are canceling your subscription by filling out this 
    a(href=payload.formLink) form.

  p If you change your mind, which we hope you do soon, you can always resubscribe through your dashboard.

  p
    a(href=payload.dashboardLink, class='btn btn-primary') Go to Your Dashboard

  p Thank you for being a part of #{payload.appName}.

  p.signature
    | Best regards,
    br
    b The #{payload.appName} Team